---
import FlowDetail from '../FlowDetail.astro';
import { FLOW_V16_SHOTS as shots } from '../../../data/flow-v16';
---
<section class="border-t border-border/60 px-6 py-14 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="tour-domains">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div><p class="of-eyebrow">Trust boundaries</p><h3 id="tour-domains" class="of-display scroll-mt-28 mt-4 text-[clamp(1.85rem,3.4vw,2.75rem)]">Set the boundary before the model.</h3><p class="of-lede mt-5">Start on this Mac or add a key for a cloud provider. Settings tells you where work runs and what it costs. A cloud key turns that provider on.</p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Local discovery opens compatible models briefly and shares the ones that work with Flow Runtime. Cost is compared before an AI run and recorded after it. A fallback that would leave this Mac stops and asks.</p><a href="/flow/settings/#models" class="of-text-action mt-6 inline-flex">Explore Models settings <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <FlowDetail src={shots.settingsModels} alt="Flow Models names this Mac, the selected model and the deciding rule." caption="Real Flow 1.6 (1899) · Your Mac and the route Flow would use" />
  </div>
</section>
